  <p id="c-songshu-048-zhuxianbin:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">伯父<persName id="c-songshu-048-zhuxianbin:p001:m0002" ref="m0r_dxh_she">憲</persName>及<persName id="c-songshu-048-zhuxianbin:p001:m0004" ref="6t2_jwb_gox">斌</persName>，並為西中郎<persName id="c-songshu-048-zhuxianbin:p001:m0011" ref="2c9_218_9b3">袁真</persName>將佐，<persName id="c-songshu-048-zhuxianbin:p001:m0016" ref="m0r_dxh_she">憲</persName>為梁國內史，<persName id="c-songshu-048-zhuxianbin:p001:m0023" ref="6t2_jwb_gox">斌</persName>為汝南內史。大司馬<persName id="c-songshu-048-zhuxianbin:p001:m0033" ref="u9s_w6j_8mc_AA">桓溫</persName>伐<persName id="c-songshu-048-zhuxianbin:p001:m0036" ref="2c9_218_9b3">真</persName>於壽陽，<persName id="c-songshu-048-zhuxianbin:p001:m0041" ref="2c9_218_9b3">真</persName>以<persName id="c-songshu-048-zhuxianbin:p001:m0043" ref="m0r_dxh_she">憲</persName>兄弟與<persName id="c-songshu-048-zhuxianbin:p001:m0047" ref="u9s_w6j_8mc_AA">溫</persName>潛通，並殺之。</p>
